      "comment": "WHERES MY REASON (7) was once again right in the mix last time out when runner-up over 1609m at this track, beaten 3 metres. Has to contend with a very wide draw. Finds a suitable assignment and will take plenty of beating once more. OPAS GIRL NZ (9) resumes here after closing her last prep with a fourth at Cambridge Raceway on April 23. Talented and has plenty of upside. Capable of playing a major role so has to be respected. BERMUDA (2) faces the starter for the first time. By Guaranteed and hails from the Jarrod Alchin stable. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Trial winner who looks above average. Sure to prove very hard to beat. THREETWONINE (1) is next best and gets every chance from a favourable draw.",
